 context and explanation for the policy debates.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/31/us/politics/debate-fact-check.html', 'snippet': 'Our reporters are following all of the exchanges. They will be fact-checking the candidates and providing context and explanation for the policy debates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The second round of Democratic debates was completed on Wednesday night in Detroit, with 10 candidates onstage for the second of two back-to-back nights. The other 10 candidates who qualified for the debates appeared Tuesday on the same stage.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/31/multimedia/31nytdebate-31/31nytdebate-31-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/31/multimedia/31nytdebate-31/31nytdebate-31-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/31/multimedia/31nytdebate-31/31nytdebate-31-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/31/multimedia/31nytdebate-31/31nytdebate-31-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/31/multimedia/31nytdebate-31/31nytdebate-31-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/31/multimedia/31nytdebate-31/31nytdebate-31-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbL