uxury.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/31/travel/raffles-singapore-hotel.html', 'snippet': 'After a two-year renovation, the historic hotel aims to attract a new generation without compromising its high standards of luxury.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In Singapore, in an intimate space full of vintage books and leather furnishings, millennials congregate after work. Some on dates, others with groups of friends, they are ready to flirt and mingle. The stylish crowd is international. Some come from across the world. Others, a taxi ride away.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Raffles Singapore Embarks on a Modern Journey', 'kicker': 'Update', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Raffles Hotel Is Embarking on a Modern Journey', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Raffles Hotel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Singapore', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maugham, William Somerset', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hotels and Travel Lodgings', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restoration and Renovation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Taylor, Elizabeth (1912-75)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-08-01T02:03:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alyson Krueger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alyson', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krueger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/18bbf80a-dc1f-59df-bf39-a72e94fafa08', 'word_count': 1027, 'uri': 'nyt://article/18bbf80a-dc1f-59df-bf39-a72e94fafa08'}, {'abstract': 'The measure, a 1981 expansion of a child care tax credit, offered families a tax credit for the cost of child care. Here’s why Mr. Biden opposed it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/07/31/us/politics/joe-biden-op-ed.html', 'snippet': 'The measure, a 1981 expansion of a child care tax credit, offered families a tax credit for the cost of child care. Here’s why Mr. Biden opposed it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Senator Kirsten Gillibrand of New York assailed former Vice President Joseph R. Biden Jr. at Wednesday night’s debate, using his 1981 vote against expanding a child care tax credit to question his commitment to women’s rights.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/31/us/politics/31breakout-gillibrand/31breakout-gillibrand-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/31/us/politics/31breakout-gillibrand/31breakout-gillibrand-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/31/us/politics/31breakout-gillibrand/31breakout-gillibrand-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/31/us/politics/31breakout-gillibrand/31breakout-gillibrand-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/31/us/politics/31breakout-gillibrand/31breakout-gillibrand-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/07/31/us/politics/31breakout-gillibrand/31bre