er as her young daughter, Lily.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/04/sports/01pelotonia-sub4/merlin_158698089_03bc4cb1-294d-44b1-82de-f5115bd134a4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/04/sports/01pelotonia-sub4/merlin_158698089_03bc4cb1-294d-44b1-82de-f5115bd134a4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/04/sports/01pelotonia-sub4/merlin_158698089_03bc4cb1-294d-44b1-82de-f5115bd134a4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/04/sports/01pelotonia-sub4/merlin_158698089_03bc4cb1-294d-44b1-82de-f5115bd134a4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/04/sports/01pelotonia-sub4/merlin_158698089_03bc4cb1-294d-44b1-82de-f5115bd134a4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/04/sports/01pelotonia-sub4/merlin_158698089_03bc4cb1-294d-44b1-82de-f5115bd134a4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/04/sports/01pelotonia-sub4/merlin_158698089_03bc4cb1-294d-44b1-82de-f5115bd134a4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'He Was the Face of a Bike-a-thon to Fight Cancer. He Was Also a Fake.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Bike-a-Thon Star Helped Raise Millions, But He Had a Secret', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Looker, John', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Brain Cancer', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bicycles and Bicycling', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Columbus (Ohio)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-08-01T09:00:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Cycling', 'byline': {'original': 'By Abby Ellin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Abby', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ellin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6a31fb05-c571-5af5-b907-41f833de6eba', 'word_count': 1785, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6a31fb05-c571-5af5-b907-41f833de6eba'}, {'abstract': 'What happens when the presses stop rolling? Who will tell the stories of touchdowns scored, heroes honored and neighbors lost? We asked news industry innovators to share their visions for what comes next, and what fills the void.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/01/us/news-deserts-future.html', 'snippet': 'What happens when the presses stop rolling? Who will tell the stories of touchdowns scored, heroes honored and neighbors lost? We asked news industry innovators to share their visions for what comes next, and what fills the void.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The most aggressive response to the collapse of local journalism has come from hundreds of upstart news outlets that have formed over the last 15 years. We asked several industry innovators — three founders of local digital operations, and the architects of a program aimed at bringing legacy newsrooms into the digital era — to share their visions of what local news can look like without a local newspaper.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/04/us/04newsfuture-rfa/merlin_158134263_46955725-7c08-4512-8c83-8d6883eedbe4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 410, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/04/us/04newsfuture-rfa/merlin_158134263_46955725-7c08-4512-8c83-8d6883eedbe4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 410}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/04/us/04newsfuture-rfa/merlin_158134263_46955725-7c08-4512-8c83-8d6883eedbe4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/04/us/04newsfuture-rfa/merlin_158134263_46955725-7c08-4512-8c83-8d6883eedbe4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1290, 'width': 1890, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/04/us/04newsfuture-rfa/merlin_158134263_46955725-7c08-4512-8c83-8d6883eedbe4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/04/us/04newsfuture-rfa/merlin_158134263_46955725-7c08-4512-8c83-8d6883eedbe4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/04/us/04newsfuture-rfa/merlin_158134263_46955725-7c08-4512-8c83-8d6883eedbe4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 15