nts is deeply unpopular in the country. On a visit, a top Trump administration official pushed the deal’s merits and gave some new details.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/01/world/americas/asylum-migrants-guatemala-trump.html', 'snippet': 'A deal requiring Guatemala to absorb Central American migrants is deeply unpopular in the country. On a visit, a top Trump administration official pushed the deal’s merits and gave some new details.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GUATEMALA CITY — One week after reaching a deal that would force Guatemala to absorb Central American migrants seeking asylum in the United States, the head of the Department of Homeland Security assured Guatemalan officials that the United States would invest in the country and try to sign similar agreements with at least five other nations in the region.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/02/world/02-GUATEMALA-02-PRINT/merlin_156689052_88fa2abd-ff3e-4cf9-8d4b-3be1535ce999-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/02/world/02-GUATEMALA-02-PRINT/merlin_156689052_88fa2abd-ff3e-4cf9-8d4b-3be1535ce999-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/02/world/02-GUATEMALA-02-PRINT/merlin_156689052_88fa2abd-ff3e-4cf9-8d4b-3be1535ce999-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/02/world/02-GUATEMALA-02-PRINT/merlin_156689052_88fa2abd-ff3e-4cf9-8d4b-3be1535ce999-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'r