 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/02/the-weekly/democrats-climate-change-green-new-deal.html', 'snippet': 'The Sunrise Movement was virtually unknown almost a year ago. Now, it’s disrupting and energizing the Democratic primary.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Many Democrats want their 2020 presidential nominee to do two things above all: Defeat Donald Trump and protect the planet from imminent environmental disaster. But liberal activists, party officials and even some of the candidates themselves disagree on how far left the party should go to successfully accomplish both tasks. How they settle their differences over proposals like the Green New Deal, a groundbreaking climate-change plan, will likely influence the party’s — and the country’s — future.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Young Climate Activists Push Democrats to the Left', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Weekly (TV Program)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Green New Deal', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sunrise Movement', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2020', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ocasio-Cortez, Alexandria', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biden, Joseph R Jr', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanders, Bernard', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Markey, Edward J', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harris, Kamala D', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Booker, Cory A', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hulu.com', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'FX (TV Net