urning after horrific mass shootings in Ohio and Texas.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/07/us/politics/trump-el-paso-dayton-visits.html', 'snippet': 'The president took sharp aim at opponents even as he visited two cities in mourning after horrific mass shootings in Ohio and Texas.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Trump landed in El Paso on Wednesday afternoon to try to console a city reeling from tragedy, but was greeted by protesters after a contentious day in which he clashed with rivals and critics even as he visited with grieving residents in Dayton, Ohio.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/07/us/politics/07dc-trumpbriefing-5/07dc-trumpbriefing-5-articleLarge-v5.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/07/us/politics/07dc-trumpbriefing-5/07dc-trumpbriefing-5-articleLarge-v5.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/07/us/politics/07dc-trumpbriefing-5/07dc-trumpbriefing-5-jumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/07/us/politics/07dc-trumpbriefing-5/07dc-trumpbriefing-5-superJumbo-v5.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/07/us/politics/07dc-trumpbriefing-5/07dc-trumpbriefing-5-thumbStandard-v6.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/07/us/politics/07dc-trumpbriefing-5/07dc-trumpbriefing-5-thumbStandard-v6.jpg', 'thumbnai