anyway. Then Toni seemed to tell me: All that reading you did before? That won’t cut it. You have to read me. She was going to make us work, not as a task, not for medicine, but because writing is an art and a reader should have a little art of his own.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/07/arts/07MORRISON-MORRIS1-promo/merlin_158977107_a2dce110-2211-4ce5-abbe-20851abc1633-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 753, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/07/arts/07MORRISON-MORRIS1-promo/merlin_158977107_a2dce110-2211-4ce5-abbe-20851abc1633-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 753}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/07/arts/07MORRISON-MORRIS1-promo/merlin_158977107_a2dce110-2211-4ce5-abbe-20851abc1633-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 817, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/07/arts/07MORRISON-MORRIS1-promo/merlin_158977107_a2dce110-2211-4ce5-abbe-20851abc1633-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1633, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/07/arts/07MORRISON-MORRIS1-promo/07MORRISON-MORRIS1-promo-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/07/arts/07MORRISON-MORRIS1-promo/07MORRISON-MORRIS1-promo-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/07/arts/07MORRISON-MORRIS1-