rticle/7d2646e3-ac29-550d-9e9a-d5b635aa7b32'}, {'abstract': 'The Senate majority leader did not back the legislation, but he said the chamber would consider it when lawmakers come back into session next month.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/09/us/politics/mcconnell-background-check-bill.html', 'snippet': 'The Senate majority leader did not back the legislation, but he said the chamber would consider it when lawmakers come back into session next month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good Friday morning. Here are some of the stories making news in Washington and politics today.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'On Politics: McConnell Might Consider Background Check Bill', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Morning Edition', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-08-09T04:27:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/66e8b902-2b52-5ebe-b9a1-cba7e51075d6', 'word_count': 432, 'uri': 'nyt://article/66e8b902-2b52-5ebe-b9a1-cba7e51075d6'}, {'abstract': '“David Bowie: Finding Fame” airs on Showtime. And stream a Kurt Weill opera on BroadwayHD.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/09/arts/television/whats-on-tv-friday-a-david-bowie-doc-and-street-scene.html', 'snippet': '“David Bowie: Finding Fame” airs on Showtime. And stream a Kurt Weill opera on BroadwayHD.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DAVID BOWIE: FINDING FAME 9 p.m. on Showtime. “I think there’s a lot of searching to find the individual within oneself,” David Bowie says in a recording near the beginning of this documentary. It’s in some ways a thesis statement of the film. “Finding Fame,” the final installment of a trilogy of Bowie documentaries from the English filmmaker Francis Whately, explores a period of Bowie’s career starting in 1965, around the time he dropped his stage name of Davie Jones in favor of Bowie, to 1973, when he dropped the Ziggy Stardust persona that had cemented his stardom. Produced by the BBC, the documentary shows an artist during a period of both commercial and self discovery.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/09/arts/09tvcol-davidbowie/09tvcol-davidbowie-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/09/arts/09tvcol-davidbowie/09tvcol-davidbowie-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/09/arts/09tvcol-davidbowie/09tvcol-davidbowie-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/09/arts/09tvcol-davidbowie/09tvcol-davidbowie-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/09/arts/09tvcol-davidbowie/09tvcol-davidbowie-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/09/arts/09tvcol-davidbowie/09tvcol-davidbowie-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/09/arts/09tvcol-davidbowie/09tvcol-davidbowie-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType':