es', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/612670de-5c88-5869-ae66-d2ee78f49cc8', 'word_count': 1158, 'uri': 'nyt://article/612670de-5c88-5869-ae66-d2ee78f49cc8'}, {'abstract': 'In a rare interview, President Emmerson D. Mnangagwa defended his political and economic record.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/10/world/africa/zimbabwe-president-emmerson-mnangagwa-mugabe.html', 'snippet': 'In a rare interview, President Emmerson D. Mnangagwa defended his political and economic record.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HARARE, Zimbabwe — Everywhere he looked, President Emmerson D. Mnangagwa could see his own face. To battle his cold, he sipped a hot drink from a mug adorned with his own head shot. To his left, an aide wore a green shirt covered with the same image. To his right was a large photograph of the president as a young man. His state portrait hung from the opposite wall.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/30/world/30Mnangagwa1/merlin_158641647_9a8d1192-4551-42a7-9990-105020d638d2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/30/world/30Mnangagwa1/merlin_158641647_9a8d1192-4551-42a7-9990-105020d638d2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/30/world/30Mnangagwa1/merlin_158641647_9a8d1192-4551-42a7-9990-105020d638d2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/30/world/30Mnangagwa1/merlin_158641647_9a8d1192-4551-42a7-9990-105020d638d2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'wid