ling minorities are aided by the fact that they can easily obtain assault weapons in this country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/10/opinion/i-fear-the-deaths-in-el-paso-wont-change-anything.html', 'snippet': 'Those who are set on killing minorities are aided by the fact that they can easily obtain assault weapons in this country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EL PASO \xad— “I don’t know why he took my boy’s life,” Dora Lizarde said. Her grandson Javier, 15, was the youngest victim of last weekend’s massacre, killed by a bullet to the head. “Fifteen years old; he still had so much time to live,” Ms. Lizarde told me in an interview this week. “I don’t know why he took him away, I don’t understand. He is young, too.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/10/opinion/10Ramos/merlin_159001476_c272a2f2-9638-4efa-9e3b-9f341879f320-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/10/opinion/10Ramos/merlin_159001476_c272a2f2-9638-4efa-9e3b-9f341879f320-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/10/opinion/10Ramos/merlin_159001476_c272a2f2-9638-4efa-9e3b-9f341879f320-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 651, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/10/opinion/10Ramos/merlin_159001476_c272a2f2-9638-4efa-9e3b-9f341879f320-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1302, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/10/opinion/10Ramos/10Ramos-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 't