st nor an ideologue, she thrived on complexities generated by doubt and uncertainty.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/11/obituaries/ann-snitow-dies.html', 'snippet': 'Neither a polemicist nor an ideologue, she thrived on complexities generated by doubt and uncertainty.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ann Snitow, a feminist writer, teacher, and passionate activist, who insisted on turning an analytical — even critical — eye toward feminism even as she organized relentlessly at its grass-roots, died on Saturday under hospice care at her home in Manhattan. She was 76. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/12/obituaries/00Snitow/00Snitow-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 603, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/12/obituaries/00Snitow/00Snitow-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 603}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/12/obituaries/00Snitow/00Snitow-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1020, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/12/obituaries/00Snitow/00Snitow-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1624, 'width': 1617, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/12/obituaries/00Snitow/00Snitow-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/12/obituaries/00Snitow/00Snitow-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url'