be trans, can’t resolve its big ideas.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/13/movies/adam-review.html', 'snippet': 'The film, about a cisgender boy who pretends to be trans, can’t resolve its big ideas.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The straight teenage protagonist of the romantic comedy “Adam” is dealt a lot of lucky breaks over the course of this often charming and occasionally aggravating coming-of-age story. But Adam’s first jackpot comes in the opening minutes when his cool older sister, Casey (Margaret Qualley), invites him to stay with her for the summer. Casey is a lesbian living in New York, where she flits among her many queer friends in political protests and sex clubs.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/13/arts/adam1/adam1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/13/arts/adam1/adam1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/13/arts/adam1/adam1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/13/arts/adam1/adam1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1153, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/13/arts/adam1/adam1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/13/arts/adam1/adam1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': No