n includes a story collection and a novel from Paul Tremblay.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/13/books/review/summer-horror-column-paul-tremblay.html', 'snippet': 'Summer’s notable horror fiction includes a story collection and a novel from Paul Tremblay.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Why read horror fiction when there is such an abundance of terror in the real world? It’s a question I ask as someone who seeks out the macabre in literature, even as I cringe at the daily news. With temperatures reaching 123 degrees in India and mass shootings continuing unabated and honey bees going the way of dodo birds, one can’t help wondering: What is the point of dark fiction when reality gives us so much to fear?', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/books/review/13Trussoni/13Trussoni-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 509, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/10/06/books/review/13Trussoni/13Trussoni-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 509}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/books/review/13Trussoni/13Trussoni-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 869, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/books/review/13Trussoni/13Trussoni-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1738, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/10/06/books/review/13Trussoni/13Trussoni-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/10/06/books/review/13Tr