e victims of a plague, the heroine of Margaret Owen’s ‘The Merciful Crow’ is out to restore her land’s rightful prince.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If a first impression is a lasting impression, then the brutal opening line of Margaret Owen’s THE MERCIFUL CROW (Holt, 374 pp., $18.99; ages 14 and up) is one you won’t likely forget: “Pa was taking too long to cut the boys’ throats.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/13/books/review/25-BKS-KIDS1/25-BKS-KIDS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 908, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/13/books/review/25-BKS-KIDS1/25-BKS-KIDS1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 908}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/13/books/review/25-BKS-KIDS1/25-BKS-KIDS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 661, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/13/books/review/25-BKS-KIDS1/25-BKS-KIDS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 661, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/13/books/review/25-BKS-KIDS1/25-BKS-KIDS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/13/books/review/25-BKS-KIDS1/25-BKS-KIDS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/13/books/review/25-BKS-KIDS1/25-BKS-KIDS1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_na