y? If you got married on a fortuitous or iconic date, we want to hear from you.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When deciding on a wedding date, many couples choose dates that are thought to be lucky or dates with a historical significance. Did you marry on Nov. 11, 2011? Or, on a day that aligned perfectly with your zodiac sign? Or did your nuptials coincide with Neil Armstrong’s moon walk? Whether you planned your special date with luck or noteworthiness in mind, we want to hear from you.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/16/fashion/00iconicweddingdate/merlin_136950459_d9865434-a997-434f-a7c8-717190db8e72-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/16/fashion/00iconicweddingdate/merlin_136950459_d9865434-a997-434f-a7c8-717190db8e72-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/16/fashion/00iconicweddingdate/merlin_136950459_d9865434-a997-434f-a7c8-717190db8e72-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/16/fashion/00iconicweddingdate/merlin_136950459_d9865434-a997-434f-a7c8-717190db8e72-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/16/fashion/00iconicweddingdate/merlin_136950459_d9865434-a997-434f-a7c8-717190db8e72-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/16/fashion/00iconicweddingdate/merlin_136950459_d9865434-a9