st on me. Long before I’d ever visited the town in Massachusetts, I knew from hippie teenage readings of Henry Beston about the lambent light suffusing this spit of dunes and beach grass at land’s end, a beckoning finger surrounded by ocean at the outermost limits of Cape Cod.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/15/fashion/13Meyerowitz-01/13Meyerowitz-01-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 757, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/15/fashion/13Meyerowitz-01/13Meyerowitz-01-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 757}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/15/fashion/13Meyerowitz-01/13Meyerowitz-01-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 812, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/15/fashion/13Meyerowitz-01/13Meyerowitz-01-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1623, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/15/fashion/13Meyerowitz-01/13Meyerowitz-01-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/15/fashion/13Meyerowitz-01/13Meyerowitz-01-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/15/fashion/13Meyerowitz-01/13Meyerowitz-01-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Recapturing a L