ecision to push some of them off until December is an admission of their impact on American consumers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/14/us/politics/china-tariffs-donald-trump.html', 'snippet': 'President Trump insists China is paying the full cost of his tariffs. But his decision to push some of them off until December is an admission of their impact on American consumers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Trump’s tariffs on Chinese imports are forcing Americans to pay more for everyday products. Many economists have shown this. If you look at the appropriate inflation data, like the rising price of imported home furnishings, you can see the effect for yourself. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Delaying Tariffs, Trump Faces Up to Economic Reality', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Tariffs Delay, Trump Concedes Consumers May Pay More', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Customs (Tariff)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prices (Fares, Fees and Rates)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Inflation (Economics)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gifts', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christmas', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Holidays and Special Occasions', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Factories and Manufacturing', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Customs and Border Protection (US)', 'rank': 12