 with the aim of stopping a no-deal Brexit, but the leader of the Liberal Democrat Party said he could not be Britain’s leader because he would not command a majority in the House of Commons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — A leading opposition lawmaker has thrown cold water on a proposal by the leader of Britain’s Labour Party, Jeremy Corbyn, aimed at preventing Britain from leaving the European Union without a deal.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/15/world/15britain/15britain-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/15/world/15britain/15britain-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/15/world/15britain/15britain-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/15/world/15britain/15britain-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/15/world/15britain/15britain-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/15/world/15britain/15britain-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/15/world/15britain/15britain-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'U.K. Lawmaker Rejects Jeremy Corbyn’s Call to Lead Caretaker Government', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Brexit Opponent Rejects Corbyn’s Bid to Lead U.K.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Great Britain Withdrawal from EU (Brexit)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Corbyn, Jeremy (1949- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Labour Party (Great Britain)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Swinson, Jo (1980- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Boris', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Conservative Party (Great Britain)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Liberal Democrat Party (Great Britain)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-08-15T14:51:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ceylan Yeginsu', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ceylan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yeginsu', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/67dcec29-889c-50ed-83be-5fc69c88432d', 'word_count': 564, 'uri': 'nyt://article/67dcec29-889c-50ed-83be-5fc69c88432d'}, {'abstract': 'In August 1944, the United States executed a gigantic assault on southern France. Why does no one remember it?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/15/opinion/the-forgotten-story-of-operation-anvil.html', 'snippet': 'In August 1944, the United States executed a gigantic assault on southern France. Why does no one remember it?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Winston Churchill once quipped that George C. Marshall, the famed American general who served as Army chief of staff during World War II, was part of the “stupidest strategic team ever seen.” The cause of the British prime minister’s ire? Operation Anvil (later renamed Dragoon), the Allied invasion of southern France that began 75 years ago Thursday. Today that operation, which historians consider one of the most successful amphibious assaults in history, is largely forgotten, overshadowed by the D-Day invasion, which took place a few months earlier and on the opposite side of France.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/15/opinion/15zinsou2-web/15zinsou2-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 439, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/15/opinion/15zinsou2-web/15zinsou2-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 439}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/15/opinion/15zinsou2-web/15zinsou2-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 749, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/15/opinion/15zinsou2-web/15zinsou2-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1463, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/15/opinion/15zinsou2-web/15zinsou2-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/15/opinion/15zinsou2-web/15zinsou2-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/15/opinion/15zinsou2-web/15zinsou2-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Forgotten Story of Operation Anvil', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'World War II (1939-45)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Red Army (Soviet Union)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Churchill, Winston Leonard Spencer', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Eisenhower, Dwight David', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stalin, Joseph', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roosevelt, Franklin Delano', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-08-15T14:53:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cameron Zinsou', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cameron', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinsou', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/8df0d77b-1867-5cc1-b2fc-f31e3a3c7791', 'word_count': 1197, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8df0d77b-1867-5cc1-b2fc-f31e3a3c7791'}, {'abstract': 'Rather than present tough choices and coherent ideas, they are mostly responding to his outrages with empty rhetoric.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/15/opinion/on-immigration-the-democrats-are-playing-into-trumps-hands.html', 'snippet': 'Rather than present tough choices and coherent ideas, they are mostly responding to his outrages with empty rhetoric.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Despite fewer unauthorized immigrants entering the United States than there were a decade ago, immigration is shaping up to be a pivotal topic in the 2020 debate. The crowded field of Democratic candidates for president have rightly called out President Trump for his racist, divisive and often false anti-immigrant rhetoric. But few have offered a compelling policy response to the president — and if they don’t, their failure may help get him re-elected.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/05/opinion/05Schuck/05Schuck-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/09/05/opinion/05Schuck/05Schuck-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/05/opinion/05Schuck/05Schuck-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/05/opinion/05Schuck/05Schuck-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/05/opinion/05Schuck/05Schuck-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/09/05/opinion/05Schuck/05Schuck-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/05/opinion/05Schuck/05Schuck-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'On Immigration, the Democrats Are Playing Into Trump’s Hands', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Playing Trump’s Immigration Game', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-08-15T14:59:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter H. Schuck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': 'H.', 'lastname': 'Schuck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/cb0eb5cb-af71-5aaa-b7f7-0ae6996d24c3', 'word_count': 1134, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cb0eb5cb-af71-5aaa-b7f7-0ae6996d24c3'}, {'abstract': 'What’s going on in his 1958 dance “Summerspace”? Nothing but life.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/15/arts/dance/merce-cunningham-summerspace.html', 'snippet': 'What’s going on in his 1958 dance “Summerspace”? Nothing but life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Three women enter the “Summerspace” stage in sweeping arcs, like birds on the wing, each in a different meter. Now they stop, making a group, as if perching on a branch. When a man enters, he’s of a different feather, advancing on a straight diagonal path in a different rhythm; and he pauses, only to reverse direction and pause again.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/24/arts/summerspace-ixion/summerspace-ixion-articleLarge.png', 'height': 329, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/07/24/arts/summerspace-ixion/summerspace-ixion-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 329}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype'