anization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5ed72dc1-e398-5a6f-813c-1876b10fb355', 'word_count': 923, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5ed72dc1-e398-5a6f-813c-1876b10fb355'}, {'abstract': 'Jacqueline Audry’s film unfolds in an almost exclusively female world, as suffocating as it is liberating.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/15/movies/olivia-movie-jacqueline-audry.html', 'snippet': 'Jacqueline Audry’s film unfolds in an almost exclusively female world, as suffocating as it is liberating.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two head teachers, who may or may not have been lovers, compete for the allegiance of their well-bred, high-spirited students in a French finishing school. The stakes are raised and the balance of power is shifted with the appearance of an English girl, Olivia, whose mad crush on one teacher is nearly reciprocated.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/16/arts/15rewind/merlin_159203229_12695d5b-c428-4f17-a422-5d7e89099d96-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 439, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/16/arts/15rewind/merlin_159203229_12695d5b-c428-4f17-a422-5d7e89099d96-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 439}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/16/arts/15rewind/merlin_159203229_12695d5b-c428-4f17-a422-5d7e89099d96-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/16/arts/15rewind/merlin_159203229_12695d5b-c428-4f17-a422-5d7e89099d96-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1475, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {