of Winston Churchill. He alone is capable of forecasting the gathering global storm and, like the great Englishman, able to “mobilize the English language and send it into battle,” as he tried to do in 2015, when he sidestepped an American president he despised to speak powerfully to Congress about the Iranian threat.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/16/opinion/16weiss-sub/merlin_158156826_de77af4b-8fc7-4991-97ae-92c3892a0243-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 407, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/16/opinion/16weiss-sub/merlin_158156826_de77af4b-8fc7-4991-97ae-92c3892a0243-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 407}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/16/opinion/16weiss-sub/merlin_158156826_de77af4b-8fc7-4991-97ae-92c3892a0243-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 694, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/16/opinion/16weiss-sub/merlin_158156826_de77af4b-8fc7-4991-97ae-92c3892a0243-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1389, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/16/opinion/16weiss-sub/16weiss-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/16/opinion/16weiss-sub/16weiss-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/16/opinion/16weiss-sub/16weiss-sub-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 't