n arms package, the single largest from the United States to Taiwan in many years, is certain to anger China and could complicate the trade war.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/16/world/asia/taiwan-f16.html', 'snippet': 'The $8 billion arms package, the single largest from the United States to Taiwan in many years, is certain to anger China and could complicate the trade war.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Trump administration is moving forward with an $8 billion sale of F-16 fighter jets to Taiwan, American officials said Friday. The move is certain to further anger China at a time when a long-running trade war between Washington and Beijing has upended relations between the world’s two largest economies and contributed to stock market turmoil.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/16/us/politics/16dc-weapons/merlin_149248533_1ad70bf5-af83-4719-816d-79529874d7e3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/16/us/politics/16dc-weapons/merlin_149248533_1ad70bf5-af83-4719-816d-79529874d7e3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/16/us/politics/16dc-weapons/merlin_149248533_1ad70bf5-af83-4719-816d-79529874d7e3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/16/us/politics/16dc-weapons/merlin_149248533_1ad70bf5-af83-4719-816d-79529874d7e3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image',