ject', 'value': 'Computer Network Outages', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRPORTS', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Customs and Border Protection (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kennedy International Airport (Queens, NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-08-16T21:19:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Express', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Mele', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mele', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa34f172-7644-5b98-aac1-38e3a26d8511', 'word_count': 465, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa34f172-7644-5b98-aac1-38e3a26d8511'}, {'abstract': 'If you’re shopping for a new TV, a new acronym should be on your radar: H.D.R., or High Dynamic Range. Soon it’ll be everywhere, but here’s why it’s worth a look now.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/16/smarter-living/hdr-is-coming-to-a-tv-near-you-heres-why-you-should-care.html', 'snippet': 'If you’re shopping for a new TV, a new acronym should be on your radar: H.D.R., or High Dynamic Range. Soon it’ll be everywhere, but here’s why it’s worth a look now.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you go shopping for a TV today, virtually everything in the store will be a 4K TV. Only some, however, have an increasingly popular feature called High Dynamic Range, or H.D.R. This little acronym can make your favorite shows look sharper, more vibrant and it might just be worth spending a little extra on your next TV.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/07/18/smarter-living/00sl-h