'_id': 'nyt://article/167529f6-714c-5bf0-8d46-f0b7abf5ffe0', 'word_count': 312, 'uri': 'nyt://article/167529f6-714c-5bf0-8d46-f0b7abf5ffe0'}, {'abstract': 'O.K., Michael Hawkins, donnez-nous les portmanteaux.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/16/crosswords/daily-puzzle-2019-08-17.html', 'snippet': 'O.K., Michael Hawkins, donnez-nous les portmanteaux.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SATURDAY PUZZLE — I really enjoyed this puzzle by Michael Hawkins, who’s been on a roll the last year or so with some high quality Wednesday and Friday offerings. At first I was on a roll myself and took note of the clever but quick top half, and this was before I saw his notes about submitting the grid as a Friday. But I think the difference between a themeless Friday and Saturday is sort of subjective anyway, and I like the idea of a puzzle that segues from one day to the next like this one seemed to, if you solved from north to south.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/17/crosswords/17wordplay-moma/17wordplay-moma-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 364, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/17/crosswords/17wordplay-moma/17wordplay-moma-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 364}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/17/crosswords/17wordplay-moma/17wordplay-moma-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 621, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/17/crosswords/17wordplay-moma/17wordplay-moma-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1242, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019