2374, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d1c45dc2-5825-56c9-a479-43f02918f3e0'}, {'abstract': 'Athletic. Flattering. Red. Who needs a string bikini?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/17/style/baywatch-swimsuit-pamela-anderson.html', 'snippet': 'Athletic. Flattering. Red. Who needs a string bikini?', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the height of its popularity, the 1990s TV show “Baywatch” was bringing in 1.1 billion worldwide weekly viewers. It made Pamela Anderson and Carmen Electra famous, revived (again) the career of David Hasselhoff and inspired a 2017 movie. Now the series can be handily retrieved on Amazon Prime and Hulu — in high definition and with 350 new original songs added to the score to help draw in millennial viewers. But what about “Baywatch” is most memorable, lasting and important?', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/18/fashion/17BAYWATCHSWIMSUIT-pamela-anderson/17BAYWATCHSWIMSUIT-pamela-anderson-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 913, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/18/fashion/17BAYWATCHSWIMSUIT-pamela-anderson/17BAYWATCHSWIMSUIT-pamela-anderson-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 913}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/18/fashion/17BAYWATCHSWIMSUIT-pamela-anderson/17BAYWATCHSWIMSUIT-pamela-anderson-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 673, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/18/fashion/17BAYWATCHSWIMSUIT-pamela-anderson/17BAYWATCHSWIMSUIT-pamela-anderson-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1346, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None,