rvice animals has raised many questions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/17/travel/mini-horse-service-plane.html', 'snippet': 'The Department of Transportation’s declaration that miniature horses should be prioritized as service animals has raised many questions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last week, after months of deliberation, the Department of Transportation released formal guidance regarding animals on planes. The 28-page document makes it clear that three types of service animals should be prioritized for travel: cats, dogs and miniature horses.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/18/multimedia/17minihoreseintheair2-print/merlin_159303183_2ffd61f9-1384-4361-a1be-16ff439a09da-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/18/multimedia/17minihoreseintheair2-print/merlin_159303183_2ffd61f9-1384-4361-a1be-16ff439a09da-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/18/multimedia/17minihoreseintheair2-print/merlin_159303183_2ffd61f9-1384-4361-a1be-16ff439a09da-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/18/multimedia/17minihoreseintheair2-print/merlin_159303183_2ffd61f9-1384-4361-a1be-16ff439a09da-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/18/multimedia/17minihoreseintheair2-print/16xp-minihorsesinair-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType