/20/world/europe/romania-prince-carol.html', 'snippet': 'Prince Carol of Romania sent a letter to his father, King Ferdinand I, renouncing his title of Crown Prince and his rights as heir to the throne.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Prince Carol of Roumania, heir-apparent to the throne, has forwarded to his father, King Ferdinand I, a letter dated August 1, renouncing his title of Crown Prince and all the rights the Constitution confers upon him as heir to the throne.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/20/world/20iht-retrospective/20iht-retrospective-jumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 531, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/20/world/20iht-retrospective/20iht-retrospective-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1120, 'width': 580, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/20/world/20iht-retrospective/20iht-retrospective-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/20/world/20iht-retrospective/20iht-retrospective-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/20/world/20iht-retrospective/20iht-retrospective-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '1919: Romanian Crown Prince Renounces His Title', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'International Herald Tribune', 'rank': 1, 'major'