orocco, has opened Le Gourmand, a gluten-free bakery there. He’s a fitness trainer who went into the baking business because his son could not tolerate gluten. Mr. Jabrane’s cakes, notably the handsome banana variety, and his well-fruited muffins are standouts. Compact breads made with grains like teff and millet are also good, and there are vegan options. After Labor Day he plans to increase his inventory to include some Moroccan specialties, and to sell sandwiches. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/19/dining/19burnerbake01/merlin_159351480_aee14b20-6d97-4fc2-adb8-1258091c3f92-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/19/dining/19burnerbake01/merlin_159351480_aee14b20-6d97-4fc2-adb8-1258091c3f92-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/19/dining/19burnerbake01/merlin_159351480_aee14b20-6d97-4fc2-adb8-1258091c3f92-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/19/dining/19burnerbake01/merlin_159351480_aee14b20-6d97-4fc2-adb8-1258091c3f92-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/19/dining/19burnerbake01/19burnerbake01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/19/dining/19burnerbake01/19burnerbake01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight'