e: Governments should intervene to help the industries and technologies of the future.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/20/opinion/america-industrial-policy.html', 'snippet': 'Many Republicans and Democrats agree: Governments should intervene to help the industries and technologies of the future.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Just a few years ago, the phrase “industrial policy” was employed mainly as a term of abuse. Economists almost universally insisted that state interventions to improve competitiveness, prioritize investment in strategic sectors and structure market incentives around political goals were backward policies doomed to failure — whether applied in America, Asia or anywhere in between.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/27/opinion/27krein-1/27krein-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 770, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/27/opinion/27krein-1/27krein-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 770}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/27/opinion/27krein-1/27krein-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 798, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/27/opinion/27krein-1/27krein-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1596, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/27/opinion/27krein-1/27krein-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/27/opinion/27krein-1/27krein-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {