value': 'Subprime Mortgage Crisis', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Friedman, Milton', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanders, Bernard', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Warren, Elizabeth', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-08-21T10:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Podcasts', 'section_name': 'Podcasts', 'subsection_name': 'The Daily', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c4922047-9965-5063-b908-df62cbb570ba', 'word_count': 256, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c4922047-9965-5063-b908-df62cbb570ba'}, {'abstract': 'Ceramic sculptures; warped photographs; floral still lifes; treasures in a trash collection; and swoops of acrylic indigo.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/21/arts/design/art-gallery-shows.html', 'snippet': 'Ceramic sculptures; warped photographs; floral still lifes; treasures in a trash collection; and swoops of acrylic indigo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Lebanese artist Simone Fattal seems to make small ceramic sculptures the way some artists dash off fast, skillful sketches. There’s a sense of intoxicating speed and wry pleasure in their loose, sometimes clumsy forms and usually bright uneven surfaces. Like the best drawn sketches, these works also have an uncanny accuracy in their approximations of the real world. The colorful parade of 170 pieces, made from 1988 to 2019 dominating “Works and Days,” Ms. Fattal’s sumptuous, and first, solo museum exhibition in the United States, conveys a strong sense of ancient cultures, recent wars, personal memory and the erosions of time.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/23/arts/22galleries-fattal/22galleries-fattal-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 378, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/23/arts/22galleries-fattal/22galleries-fattal-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 378}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/23/arts/22galleries-fattal/22galleries-fattal-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 646, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/23/arts/22galleries-fattal/22galleries-fattal-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1261, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/23/arts/22galleries-fattal/22galleries-fattal-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/23/arts/22galleries-fattal/22galleries-fattal-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/23/arts/22galleries-fattal/22galleries-fattal-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New York Galleries: What to See Right Now', 'kicker': 'Art Reviews', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Galleries', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fattal, Simone', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Transmitter (Brooklyn, NY, Gallery)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'White Columns (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'