ura', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cappelle', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0dbfe9e2-a938-54b2-8747-a0ecc6be1cfc', 'word_count': 1116, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0dbfe9e2-a938-54b2-8747-a0ecc6be1cfc'}, {'abstract': 'A pacemaker was supposed to solve his heart problem. But despite the device, he was experiencing strange and scary episodes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/22/magazine/why-was-the-middle-aged-mans-heart-beating-so-dangerously-fast.html', 'snippet': 'A pacemaker was supposed to solve his heart problem. But despite the device, he was experiencing strange and scary episodes.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Listen, I’ve got to call you back,” the 48-year-old man said to his client when the now-familiar but still-terrifying feeling started. He felt dizzy and lightheaded, as if he were about to faint. He hung up the phone in his Manhattan office and headed toward the nurse. He took no more than a dozen steps when he realized he wasn’t going to make it. He lurched to his knees, then tried to lower himself to the ground, because he knew he wouldn’t stay upright for long. There was a sound like a firecracker, then another, as he slumped onto the ground. When he opened his eyes, half a dozen colleagues were there. Hands rolled him over and loosened his tie. “Stay down,” a voice instructed. “Help is on the way.”', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/25/magazine/25mag-diagnosis-1/25mag-diagnosis-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/25/magazine/25mag-diagnosis-1/25mag-diagnosis-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/25/magazine/25mag-diagnosis-1/25mag-diagnosis-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/25/magazine/25mag-diagnosis-1/25mag-diagnosis-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/25/magazine/25mag-diagnosis-1/25mag-diagnosis-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/25/magazine/25mag-diagnosis-1/25mag-diagnosis-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/25/magazine/25mag-diagnosis-1/25mag-diagnosis-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Why Was the Middle Aged Man’s Heart Beating so Dangerously Fast?', 'kicker': 'Diagnosis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Why Was the Middle Aged Man’s Heart Beating so Dangerously Fast?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Heart', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sarcoidosis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pacemakers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-08-22T09:00:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lisa Sanders, M.D', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lisa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sanders', 'qualifier': 'M.D', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': N