-old is heading off to college. I’m about 50 percent sure he’ll be fine. The other 50 percent is convinced his corpse will be discovered under a pile of filthy laundry, charred beyond recognition because I wasn’t there to tell him not to put That Thing in Tin Foil That’s Too Old to Eat into the microwave. Alternatively, he will die from fright, having had to kill a bug on his own.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/25/books/review/25HelpDesk/25HelpDesk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 984, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/25/books/review/25HelpDesk/25HelpDesk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 984}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/25/books/review/25HelpDesk/25HelpDesk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 625, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/25/books/review/25HelpDesk/25HelpDesk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1249, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/25/books/review/25HelpDesk/25HelpDesk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/25/books/review/25HelpDesk/25HelpDesk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/25/books/review/25HelpDesk/25HelpDesk-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', '