, Tracy Austin and Serena Williams.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/24/sports/tennis/us-open-history-rod-laver.html', 'snippet': 'This year’s U.S. Open is a good time to remember significant victories for Rod Laver, Andre Agassi, Tracy Austin and Serena Williams.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last year, the U.S. Open celebrated its 50th anniversary. This year brings notable anniversaries for some of the tournament’s most memorable matches and most famous champions. Most significant is the 50th anniversary of Rod Laver’s second Grand Slam in 1969. He is only man to accomplish the feat twice, and no man has completed a Grand Slam since. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/22/sports/22open-anniversaries-promo/22open-anniversaries-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 391, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/22/sports/22open-anniversaries-promo/22open-anniversaries-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 391}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/22/sports/22open-anniversaries-promo/22open-anniversaries-promo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 666, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/22/sports/22open-anniversaries-promo/22open-anniversaries-promo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1236, 'width': 1899, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/22/sports/22open-anniversaries-promo/22open-anniversaries-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard',