nto the playoffs in consecutive seasons, in 2017 and 2018. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/26/sports/26yankees/merlin_159727443_eb81ce7d-58da-4511-90d1-3d1d604f1503-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 442, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/26/sports/26yankees/merlin_159727443_eb81ce7d-58da-4511-90d1-3d1d604f1503-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 442}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/26/sports/26yankees/merlin_159727443_eb81ce7d-58da-4511-90d1-3d1d604f1503-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 755, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/26/sports/26yankees/merlin_159727443_eb81ce7d-58da-4511-90d1-3d1d604f1503-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1510, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/26/sports/26yankees/26yankees-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/26/sports/26yankees/26yankees-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/26/sports/26yankees/26yankees-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Yankees Won Their Series Against the Dodgers. They Would Welcome Another.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fond of Hollywood, Yanks Eye a Sequel', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Dodgers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Judge, Aaron (1992- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kershaw, Clayton', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'LeMahieu, David John (DJ) (1988- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-08-26T15:16:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Wagner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wagner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/18bfd64e-0bab-53cb-b36c-f2086daf5ea2', 'word_count': 797, 'uri': 'nyt://article/18bfd64e-0bab-53cb-b36c-f2086daf5ea2'}, {'abstract': 'What is there left to defend to foreign audiences, other than a promise that we’re a democracy and that there are future elections to come?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/26/opinion/trump-state-department.html', 'snippet': 'What is there left to defend to foreign audiences, other than a promise that we’re a democracy and that there are future elections to come?', 'lead_paragraph': 'When President Trump allowed a crowd to chant “Send her back!” about a sitting member of Congress — espousing an ideology in which naturalized American citizens, at least those who don’t fit a certain profile, are held to different and dangerous standards — he wasn’t thinking about me. He’s rarely thinking about me, the white American-born daughter of two American-born citizens.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype'