anks on the Billboard 200, it has already become the year’s top-selling album.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The release of a new album by Taylor Swift — whose “Lover” came out on Friday — practically serves as a memo to all other artists with records on the way: Get your album out before hers, or abandon any hope of reaching No. 1.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/26/arts/26billboard/26billboard-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 498, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/26/arts/26billboard/26billboard-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 498}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/26/arts/26billboard/26billboard-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 849, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/26/arts/26billboard/26billboard-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1698, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/26/arts/26billboard/26billboard-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/26/arts/26billboard/26billboard-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/26/arts/26billboard/26billboard-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Young Thug Hits No. 1, but Taylor Swift Is Already the Charts’ Bi