ntradictions in the Standard Model, the template that forms the backbone of our understanding of fundamental particles and the universe, died on Aug. 4 in the Alpine Lakes Wilderness in Washington State. She was 61. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/obituaries/25nelsonobit/25nelsonobit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/28/obituaries/25nelsonobit/25nelsonobit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/obituaries/25nelsonobit/25nelsonobit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/obituaries/25nelsonobit/25nelsonobit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/obituaries/25nelsonobit/25nelsonobit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/28/obituaries/25nelsonobit/25nelsonobit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/obituaries/25nelsonobit/25nelsonobit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ann Nelson, Expert on Particle Physics, Is Dead at 61', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ann Nelson, 61, Who Solved Riddles of Particle Physics', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nelson, Ann (1958-2019)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Physics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-08-26T19:52:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Science', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dylan Loeb McClain', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dylan', 'middlename': 'Loeb', 'lastname': 'McClain', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/49f7347c-c7a0-545a-8301-1e2e697d7dc4', 'word_count': 979, 'uri': 'nyt://article/49f7347c-c7a0-545a-8301-1e2e697d7dc4'}, {'abstract': 'The sprawling space in Industry City is its second location.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/26/dining/sahadis-industry-city.html', 'snippet': 'The sprawling space in Industry City is its second location.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In business since 1948, Sahadi’s, the family-owned Middle Eastern food bazaar on Atlantic Avenue in Brooklyn, is opening a second location on Thursday. It’s a spacious store and cafe in Industry City, Brooklyn, conveniently near its wholesale warehouse. In addition to a vast array of dried fruits, nuts roasted in-house and olives, the outpost offers a number of new features. “We’re doing lots of things there wasn’t room for in the original store,” said Christine Sahadi Whelan, an owner. Cheeses are cut to order, the olives are self-service and saj, a kind of flatbread, is being baked on a special domed griddle. Blue Marble is making ice creams for the store with flavors like orange-apricot, sahlab-mastic-pistachio and vanilla-tahini-date. And there is a bar and cafe serving mezze like falafel and grilled shrimp, with Lebanese and Moroccan wines and beer and a chef, Alexander Dinnerstein, in charge. New products from Lebanon, including syrups of mulberry and bitter orange, line the shelves.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/dining/28BURNER-Sahadis/28BURNER-Sahadis-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/28/dining/28BURNER-Sahadis/28BURNER-Sahadis-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/dining/28BURNER-Sahadis/28BURNER-Sahadis-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/dining/28BURNER-Sahadis/28BURNER-Sahadis-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/dining/28BURNER-Sahadis/28BURNER-Sahadis-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/28/dining/28BURNER-Sahadis/28BURNER-Sahadis-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/dining/28BURNER-Sahadis/28BURNER-Sahadis-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sahadi’s Opens a New Store in Brooklyn', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Shop: Sahadi’s Opens A New Store in Brooklyn', 'name': None, 'se