 hall from the restaurant Shun, is a gin-based drink you can make at home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/26/dining/drinks/la-mademoiselle-cocktail-recipe.html', 'snippet': 'La Mademoiselle, from the new cocktail lounge across the hall from the restaurant Shun, is a gin-based drink you can make at home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For a refreshing, even festive drink, there is now La Mademoiselle served in Bar Shun, the stunning new, brass-trimmed cocktail lounge across the hall from the restaurant Shun. The cocktail, created by Dushan Zaric, is grapefruit-based. To make it at home, combine 2 ounces each of pink grapefruit juice and gin, a half-ounce of simple syrup and 8 dashes of grapefruit bitters in a mixing glass, stirring over ice. Strain into an ice-filled goblet and finish with a splash of 2 ounces or so of prosecco. The garnish is a piney sprig of rosemary.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/26/dining/26BurnerDrink/merlin_159574887_db91ed11-1d17-40b0-93aa-df39202a6bfc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/26/dining/26BurnerDrink/merlin_159574887_db91ed11-1d17-40b0-93aa-df39202a6bfc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/26/dining/26BurnerDrink/merlin_159574887_db91ed11-1d17-40b0-93aa-df39202a6bfc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/26/dining/26BurnerDrink/merlin_159574887_db91ed11-1d17-40b0-93aa-df39202a6bfc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJu