cle/027961b1-d858-5fbb-afbc-1719bd05ca93'}, {'abstract': 'The president made inaccurate claims about planes, trade, automobiles, China and Iran during events with world leaders on Monday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/26/us/politics/fact-check-trump-g7.html', 'snippet': 'The president made inaccurate claims about planes, trade, automobiles, China and Iran during events with world leaders on Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tariffs imposed on imports of foreign goods do not mean another country is paying the bill. The costs are largely passed on to American companies and consumers, as recent studies from economists at Princeton University and Columbia University, the Federal Reserve Bank of New York and the International Monetary Fund have shown.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/26/us/politics/26dc-factcheck1/26dc-factcheck1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/26/us/politics/26dc-factcheck1/26dc-factcheck1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/26/us/politics/26dc-factcheck1/26dc-factcheck1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/26/us/politics/26dc-factcheck1/26dc-factcheck1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/26/us/politics/26dc-factcheck1/26dc-factcheck1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbna