chool at Eglin Air Force Base in Fort Walton Beach, Fla., that is about to change.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/27/magazine/27atwar-EOD-BRAIN/merlin_68314609_f006a498-5abd-4bfe-9018-31d2ab05337f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/27/magazine/27atwar-EOD-BRAIN/merlin_68314609_f006a498-5abd-4bfe-9018-31d2ab05337f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/27/magazine/27atwar-EOD-BRAIN/merlin_68314609_f006a498-5abd-4bfe-9018-31d2ab05337f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/27/magazine/27atwar-EOD-BRAIN/merlin_68314609_f006a498-5abd-4bfe-9018-31d2ab05337f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/27/magazine/27atwar-EOD-BRAIN/27atwar-EOD-BRAIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/27/magazine/27atwar-EOD-BRAIN/27atwar-EOD-BRAIN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/27/magazine/27atwar-EOD-BRAIN/27atwar-EOD-BRAIN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When Bomb Blasts Are a Job Hazard, This Test Could Help Measure Their Effects', 'kicker': None, '