8-38f836a26789', 'word_count': 900, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3037c4d6-5897-52a7-b018-38f836a26789'}, {'abstract': 'The mayor has said education is his signature issue. Now he’s been handed a provocative proposal that could transform the system.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/27/nyregion/de-blasio-gifted-talented-nyc.html', 'snippet': 'The mayor has said education is his signature issue. Now he’s been handed a provocative proposal that could transform the system.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two years ago, under pressure from progressive supporters to integrate New York City’s deeply divided school system, Mayor Bill de Blasio set up a task force to develop proposals.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/nyregion/28NYGIFTEDREAX-print/merlin_159801750_0ca4d77a-b814-46e9-adb6-e84c1e982fbe-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/28/nyregion/28NYGIFTEDREAX-print/merlin_159801750_0ca4d77a-b814-46e9-adb6-e84c1e982fbe-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/nyregion/28NYGIFTEDREAX-print/merlin_159801750_0ca4d77a-b814-46e9-adb6-e84c1e982fbe-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/nyregion/28NYGIFTEDREAX-print/merlin_159801750_0ca4d77a-b814-46e9-adb6-e84c1e982fbe-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/nyregion/28NYGIFTEDREAX-print/27NYGIF