://article/e4f4a688-3a87-5009-b457-42438e60d74a'}, {'abstract': 'Prosecutions of opioid makers like Johnson & Johnson shouldn’t leave people suffering unspeakable pain.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/29/opinion/johnson-and-johnson-lawsuit.html', 'snippet': 'Prosecutions of opioid makers like Johnson & Johnson shouldn’t leave people suffering unspeakable pain.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The decision on Monday by an Oklahoma judge to fine Johnson & Johnson $572 million for its role in the state’s opioid crisis is only the first step in what promises to be years of complex litigation. In ruling that pharmaceutical marketing caused a “public nuisance” by increasing addiction and overdose deaths, Judge Thad Balkman created a strong precedent.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/opinion/28szalavitz2/28szalavitz2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 374, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/28/opinion/28szalavitz2/28szalavitz2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 374}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/opinion/28szalavitz2/28szalavitz2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/opinion/28szalavitz2/28szalavitz2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1277, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/28/opinion/28szalavitz2/28szalavitz2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/28/opinion/28szalavitz2/28s