dalus, desperate for them to escape the wrath of King Minos, built wings out of twine, wax and plumes shed by passing birds — an outfit that might as easily have appeared on a 19th-century cancan dancer at the Moulin Rouge in Paris. Don’t mistake costume for prowess, Icarus was warned, but in the ecstasy of seeing the world from above, he forgot his human limitations and flew too high: When the sun melted the wax, he lost his wings and dropped from the sky.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '121', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/29/t-magazine/29tmag-feathers-slide-274G/29tmag-feathers-slide-274G-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 467, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/08/29/t-magazine/29tmag-feathers-slide-274G/29tmag-feathers-slide-274G-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 467}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/29/t-magazine/29tmag-feathers-slide-274G/29tmag-feathers-slide-274G-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 797, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/29/t-magazine/29tmag-feathers-slide-274G/29tmag-feathers-slide-274G-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1594, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/08/29/t-magazine/29tmag-feathers-slide-274G/29tmag-feathers-slide-274G-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/08/29/t-magazine/29tmag-feathers-slide-274G/29tmag-feathers-slide-274G-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailhei