4a-38b4eabc8a92'}, {'abstract': 'Several members of the same family get by on less than six hours of sleep a night. Their genetics could illuminate how sleep works for the rest of us.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/08/30/science/sleep-gene.html', 'snippet': 'Several members of the same family get by on less than six hours of sleep a night. Their genetics could illuminate how sleep works for the rest of us.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For as long as Brad Johnson can remember, he has never been able to sleep more than six hours a night. Most nights, he sleeps even less. Mr. Johnson, 63, always wakes without an alarm clock, feeling rested and ready for the day. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/10/science/30TB-SLEEPGENE/merlin_159220269_60f05b75-21fb-4ba8-899d-06b1d557fddf-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/09/10/science/30TB-SLEEPGENE/merlin_159220269_60f05b75-21fb-4ba8-899d-06b1d557fddf-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/10/science/30TB-SLEEPGENE/merlin_159220269_60f05b75-21fb-4ba8-899d-06b1d557fddf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/10/science/30TB-SLEEPGENE/merlin_159220269_60f05b75-21fb-4ba8-899d-06b1d557fddf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/09/10/science/30TB-SLEEPGENE/30TB-SLEEPGENE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, '